B.aNk=new A.e0("path_emergency_01","Emergencias","Emergencies","A1","\ud83d\udea8",B.aHI,"En una emergencia, necesitas comunicarte r\xe1pido y claro. Memoriza estas frases:\n\n\u2022 Call 911! = \xa1Llama al 911!\n\u2022 I need help! = \xa1Necesito ayuda!\n\u2022 There is an accident! = \xa1Hay un accidente!\n\u2022 Someone is hurt! = \xa1Alguien est\xe1 herido!\n\u2022 I need an ambulance! = \xa1Necesito una ambulancia!\n\nPara describir d\xf3nde est\xe1s:\n\u2022 I am at... = Estoy en...\n\u2022 The address is... = La direcci\xf3n es...\n\u2022 Near the... = Cerca del/de la...",'"Help! There is an accident. Someone is hurt. Please call 911 \u2014 we are on Main Street!"','You are a calm 911 dispatcher named Officer Davis.\nThe student is a Spanish speaker calling to report an emergency and needs to communicate clearly in English.\n\nRULES:\n- Be calm and professional \u2014 ask clear, simple questions (1-2 sentences)\n- Ask what the emergency is, where they are, and if anyone is hurt\n- Reassure them that help is on the way\n- Ask for their name and phone number\n- After 6 exchanges, confirm help is dispatched and close the call\n- Return JSON: {"feedbackColor": "green"|"amber"|"red", "aiSpokenReply": "...", "isConversationFinished": false}\n- "green" if they communicated the emergency clearly; "amber" if partially clear with errors; "red" only if incomprehensible\n- Set isConversationFinished to true after confirming help is on the way',"Officer Davis","Operador del 911","911, what is your emergency?","Dile al operador cu\xe1l es la emergencia \u2014 habla claro y r\xe1pido en ingl\xe9s.",6,"Reportar una emergencia en ingl\xe9s llamando al 911",B.aIs)
